  "reasoning": "The defendant pretended to be a guest, used deception to gain access to the hotel front desk, and then took cash (RMB 9,400) that belonged to the hotel without any use of force or threat. This conduct fits the legal definition of theft (盗窃), as it involves the unlawful taking of another's property with intent to permanently deprive the owner. No violence or intimidation was used, so robbery (抢劫) does not apply.",
